<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jul 21 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper up 3250, tin down 30, lead up 325, zinc down 3650, aluminium down 2700, nickel up 54, aluminium alloy down 400</p>
</text>
